/-!
# A coefficient-independent closed support bound for original errors

Map the geometric scalar ideal to the unchanged boundary source ring. Outside
its closed support, an actual geometric generator avoids the source prime and
solves every original localized correction equation. No assertion that this
ideal is the unit ideal is made.
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section
open CategoryTheory CategoryTheory.Limits AlgebraicGeometry Opposite
namespace FLT.Mazur.HilbertChart.AffineRestriction
